# Everything is stored and checked out as LF.
#
# The repository has no files that need CRLF on disk (no .bat/.cmd/.ps1), and a
# checkout whose line endings depend on the platform makes text parsing
# platform-dependent too: a contract test that splits source on `\n` passed here
# and found nothing on the Windows CI runner. Pin the line ending once, so the
# same bytes are read everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must not be normalised at all.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dmg binary
*.deb binary
*.AppImage binary
